      "text": "A hand-drawn 2D anime game animation of a disciplined armored knight breathing in a steady defensive guard. The fully closed helmet, battered ivory-white plate armor with dark red cracks, pointed kite shield and straight sword stay faithful to the reference image. He remains in the same broad planted right-facing stance throughout. The animation is a small repeated breathing cycle: his chest expands outward on the inhale and settles inward on the exhale, the shoulder plates gently settle with the breath, and the loose torn waist cloth softly sways and settles. He completes the whole inhale and exhale and returns to the same resting guard, repeating this breathing cycle several times with an even unhurried rhythm. His neck remains upright and his helmet stays level and steady, watching the opponent without nodding. His knees remain at the same bent angle, holding a stable height. Both forearms hold a steady guard throughout: the right hand stays low by his hip, the sword stays at the same low diagonal angle with the tip down and right; the left forearm keeps the shield upright at the same height. The weapons are supported, not swung or lifted. The sword and shield are rigid and keep their original shape and length. Both feet stay flat in exactly the same spots. Same helmet, same costume, same colors, same silhouette and proportions. Fixed camera, full body always visible, flat plain green background. Only breathing and the cloth's soft secondary motion, no attack, no flourish, no magic effects."
